  "details": "I am experiencing the same issue on Meta Quest 3S (standalone).\n\nSince November 4, 2026, my own avatar and all Android-compatible avatars have been replaced with the ERROR robot.\n\nWorlds, voice chat, and other functions work normally. Avatar thumbnails and friends' profile images are displayed correctly, but 3D avatars cannot load.\n\nI have already tried:\n\n- Restarting the headset and VRChat multiple times\n\n- Clearing the VRChat cache\n\n- Connecting through a different network using mobile hotspot\n\n- Using \"Show Avatar\" on friends\n\nNone of these steps fixed the issue.\n\nVRChat version: 2026.4.1p1-299983b13b-Release\n\nCould you investigate whether this is a Quest standalone issue?",
